red quarter-hyperbola are\n\n$$\nx=\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\sqrt{6}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,t\\in [-\\pi ,-\\frac{\\pi }{2}).\n$$" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331471 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331472 13194139535105 true] [17592186331471 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331473 13194139535105 true] [17592186331471 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535105 true] [17592186331471 1041 "field-1" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331471 1104 #edb/ref 17592186331472 13194139535105 true] [17592186331471 1110 #uuid "feb3c842-a366-5fa5-b0eb-b3e573c27efb" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331472 1034 "-\\pi" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331472 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331472 1111 #uuid "8e79ab75-6bf0-51df-b198-33b5f76831cb" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331473 1034 "0" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331473 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331473 1111 #uuid "14140dcb-a619-5447-bdc3-acc8ad253aad" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331474 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331475 13194139535105 true] [17592186331474 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535105 true] [17592186331474 1041 "field-2" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331474 1104 #edb/ref 17592186331475 13194139535105 true] [17592186331474 1110 #uuid "173700aa-587b-5075-ba28-7abe8c0039d8" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331475 1034 "-\\frac{\\pi}{2}" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331475 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331475 1111 #uuid "87825b4c-9345-5473-8ba0-aee302e06a27" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331476 1017 #edb/ref 17592186331477 13194139535105 true] [17592186331476 1089 "q-7990" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331476 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535105 true] [17592186331476 1100 "What are the parametric equations of the hyperbola $2{x}^{2}-49{y}^{2}=98?$" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331476 1113 #uuid "be3bee13-1da7-5350-b9bd-f380fd194d20" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331476 1145 "The parametric equations of a horizontal hyperbola with Cartesian equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=b\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$\n\nFirst, we rewrite the equation of our hyperbola in standard form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}^{2}-49{y}^{2} & =98 \\\\ \\frac{2{x}^{2}}{98}-\\frac{49{y}^{2}}{98} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{49}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we $a=\\sqrt{49}=7$ and $b=\\sqrt{2}.$ Therefore, the parametric equations are\n\n$$\nx=7\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331478 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331479 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331480 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331481 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331482 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1041 "selection" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1104 #edb/ref 17592186331479 13194139535105 true] [17592186331477 1110 #uuid "8f6291c3-8bfa-53c8-b19f-148cca1c0c2b" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331478 1034 "x=\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=7\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331478 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331478 1111 #uuid "e15db1e5-1756-5827-a435-bee61be311d0" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331479 1034 "x=7\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331479 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331479 1111 #uuid "df5063b5-4d45-5076-8a27-6a94a970cb57" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331480 1034 "x=14\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=2\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331480 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331480 1111 #uuid "93eea5f3-1f50-5275-93d2-9129efdf0d93" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331481 1034 "x=7\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=2\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331481 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331481 1111 #uuid "4acc9fbf-4b07-51ad-b61e-fd254420b2a3" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331482 1034 "x=14\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331482 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331482 1111 #uuid "28df5361-294d-56eb-9a12-54f0baba527d" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331483 1017 #edb/ref 17592186331484 13194139535105 true] [17592186331483 1089 "q-89197" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331483 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535105 true] [17592186331483 1100 "What are the parametric equations of the hyperbola $9{x}^{2}-36{y}^{2}=36?$" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331483 1113 #uuid "f81ef912-31de-5809-a190-3e000703e934" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331483 1145 "The parametric equations of a horizontal hyperbola with Cartesian equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=b\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$\n\nFirst, we rewrite the equation of our hyperbola in standard form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{x}^{2}-36{y}^{2} & =36 \\\\ \\frac{9{x}^{2}}{36}-\\frac{36{y}^{2}}{36} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-{y}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we $a=\\sqrt{4}=2$ and $b=1.$ Therefore, the parametric equations are\n\n$$\nx=2\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331485 13194139535105 true] [17592186331484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331486 13194139535105 true] [17592186331484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331487 13194139535105 true] [17592186331484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331488 13194139535105 true] [17592186331484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331489 13194139535105 true] [17592186331484 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535105 true] [17592186331484 1041 "selection" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331484 1104 #edb/ref 1