 $x$-equation and squaring, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =5\\operatorname{sec}⁡t \\\\ \\frac{x}{5} & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡t \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{{5}^{2}} & ={sec}^{2}⁡t \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{25} & ={sec}^{2}⁡t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Isolating the $\\operatorname{tan}⁡t$ term in the $y$-equation and squaring, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =2\\operatorname{tan}⁡t \\\\ \\frac{y}{2} & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡t \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & ={tan}^{2}⁡t \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & ={tan}^{2}⁡t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the two equations into the identity ${tan}^{2}⁡t+1={sec}^{2}⁡t$ and rearranging, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{tan}^{2}⁡t+1 & ={sec}^{2}⁡t \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}+1 & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{25} \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{25}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331492 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331493 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331494 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331495 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331496 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1041 "selection" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1104 #edb/ref 17592186331496 13194139535105 true] [17592186331491 1110 #uuid "a322e125-fa3a-561d-98ec-8055a2da81a1" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331492 1034 "\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{25}=1" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331492 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331492 1111 #uuid "ff123e67-4836-5a51-8902-5a2f376107ca" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331493 1034 "\\frac{{y}^{2}}{25}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}=1" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331493 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535105 true] [17592186331493 1111 #uuid "717013dd-2e30-5602-a1e4-797b1289cb9d" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331494 1034 "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{5}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}=1" 13194139535105 true] [17592186331494 1103 #e